  "body_html": "<h1>Ex-Ante Revelation Principle Interface</h1>\n<p>Given an indirect Bayesian mechanism with transfers and an ex-ante Bayesian\nNash equilibrium strategy profile, the direct-revelation mechanism induced by\nthat profile satisfies the ex-ante revelation-principle conclusion.</p>",
